OL,3,GNEWSAPig abuser sentenced after being
OL,4,Acaught on camera
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former worker at a boar stud farm
OL,7,Frepeatedly abused pigs in his care by
OL,8,Fhitting them with a pitchfork and a
OL,9,Fpipe, a court has heard.
OL,11,FSteven Woolger, 48, has been given a
OL,12,Fsuspended 17-week jail sentence for the
OL,13,Foffences committed in 2024 at an
OL,14,FInnovis boar semen collection centre at
OL,15,FBurgh Castle in Norfolk.
OL,17,FHe was captured on camera repeatedly
OL,18,Fabusing the pigs through an
OL,19,Finvestigation by Animal Justice
OL,20,FProject.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
