OL,3,GNEWSAPig abuser sentenced after being
OL,4,Acaught on camera
OL,5,
OL,6,FDistrict judge Matthew Bone also banned
OL,7,FWoolger, of Marsh Farm, Great Yarmouth,
OL,8,Ffrom being involved in the care or
OL,9,Ftransportation of animals for 10 years.
